// Deterministic Profile-Guided Optimization (`--pgo-gen` / `--pgo-use`), `.axprof` Binary Schema,
// Weighted Profile Merging, Stale-Profile Graceful Fallback, and Epistemic Cost-Model Guidance (T622 / E15.6).
// Implements SPEC-75 §§4, 5, 8..11 (AXS-PGO-001..008, AXS-LTO-030, AXS-PGO-015;
// REQ-OPT-223..241, REQ-OPT-246..256, REQ-OPT-279..282, REQ-OPT-291, REQ-OPT-319, REQ-OPT-377..378, REQ-OPT-383..384):
//   - Three-tier epistemic separation (`EPISTEMIC_PROVEN`, `EPISTEMIC_OBSERVED`, `EPISTEMIC_HEURISTIC`):
//     PGO guides profitability/cost-models only and NEVER upgrades `CERTAINTY_UNKNOWN`/`CERTAINTY_POSSIBLE` to `CERTAINTY_PROVEN` (`AXS-PGO-002`)
//   - Canonical `.axprof` binary profile schema (`AXPF` magic, schema v1, target triple, 64-bit integrity digest)
//     with deterministic serialization (`pgo_serialize_profile`) and fail-closed deserialization (`pgo_deserialize_profile`) (`AXS-PGO-003`)
//   - Deterministic `--pgo-gen` counter instrumentation (`pgo_instrument_body`, `pgo_compute_cfg_fingerprint`)
//     and commutative/associative saturating 64-bit profile merging (`pgo_merge_profiles`) (`AXS-PGO-004`)
//   - Four-level profile compatibility classification (`EXACT`, `COMPATIBLE`, `STALE`, `INCOMPATIBLE`) with
//     graceful stale-profile confidence decay + warning fallback without aborting compilation (`pgo_classify_and_bind_function`) (`AXS-PGO-005`)
//   - PGO-guided cost models for inlining, value-guarded specialization, guarded speculative devirtualization,
//     loop unrolling/peeling, SIMD width selection, hot/cold block splitting, branch fall-through layout,
//     CPU `jcc` vs `cmovcc`, and security/constant-time/atomic/volatile barriers (`pgo_compute_cost_guidance`) (`AXS-PGO-006..008`)
//   - `PassManager` `TransformationContract` (`PASS_PGO = 19u16`) and deterministic `--emit=pgo` (`pgo_print`) (`AXS-LTO-030`, `AXS-PGO-015`)
module compiler.opt.pgo

